Package: stegseek
Version: 0.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, gzip, sed, make, cmake, clang, binutils, libmhash, libmcrypt, libjpeg-turbo, zlib
Section: stego
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/RickdeJager/StegSeek
Description: Lightning-fast steghide password cracker
 stegseek cracks steghide-protected JPEG files at speeds up to
 thousands of passwords per second, and can also embed files and
 check for steganographic content in images.
